<title>USA: TABLE-Footstar June same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Footstar June same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>MAHWAH, N.J. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $179.1     $161.8     +10.7	 +5.3</p>
<p>NOTE:  Year-to-date total sales increased 6.1 percent and the same-store sales increased 1.4 percent.  The company was not immediately available to report the year-to-date dollar figures.</p>
<p>Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is  five weeks ended	  July 5.</p>
<p>Full company name is Footstar Inc.</p>
